{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721802001:1":{"text":"Ah... you're finally awake.","source_cn":"啊哈……你醒啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10AB3DA694FD49C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721802002:1":{"text":"You must've overcome that huge creature. Look at your soul! It's shining bright and steady!","source_cn":"看来你战胜了那个大家伙呢。你的灵魂波动变得……唔，很亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD5C911F56FDE2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721802003:1":{"text":"... Yes, I did.","source_cn":"……是的，冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E42E70469429459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721802004:1":{"text":"I saw the dragon... it was nothing more than a projection of my own weakness.","source_cn":"我看到了……那个所谓“真实的巨龙”，其实就是我自己内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC97CDEC4FF179EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721802005:1":{"text":"And I've bested it.","source_cn":"但我已经击败了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x315BBDA494719889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721802006:1":{"text":"So, how are you feeling?","source_cn":"感觉如何？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D68540E21E9A148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721802007:1":{"text":"Never better.","source_cn":"感觉……前所未有的好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA092CE178EECAEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721802008:1":{"text":"My grip on the bow is firm, and the voices of doubt in my head are gone. I know exactly what I must do now.","source_cn":"握弓的手不再犹豫，心里的杂音也消失了。我现在很清楚自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523C6A7AB8AFA4EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721802009:1":{"text":"Aurora, thank you for your help. Through this dream, I've rediscovered what truly matters.","source_cn":"奥萝菈冕下，感谢您的援手。这场梦境让我找回了比箭术更重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1871F0417CB74059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721802010:1":{"text":"*Yawn* It's not a big deal...","source_cn":"唔……不用谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641FD9D5D37B0A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721802011:1":{"text":"I really should go back to Avalon... and get some sleep...","source_cn":"那我也回阿瓦隆……补觉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407C625B088DBDD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721802012:0":{"text":"It's time I head back to the base, ready my gear, and then set out for the battlefield...","source_cn":"我也该奔赴我要去的战场了……接下来，回到驻地整理行装直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC65574FF6884BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721802013:1":{"text":"As for Father... I'll speak to him when I return victorious.","source_cn":"父亲那里……等我带着战功回来再向他致意吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA7F7B1221409BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"Aurora","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}